{"version":1,"content":"<p>資深演員石修的兒子陳宇琛（Sam）於2017年與前有線主播林佑蔚（Camille）結婚，二人育有一女。</p><p>雖然已為人母，但林佑蔚向來作風大膽，不吝嗇展示火辣身材，經常在社交平台分享性感美照及跳舞短片派福利。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T18:15:10.324470+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T18:01:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T18:08:27.868427+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T18:08:27.868427+00:00","content_hash":"5e73d1f992cc82c50fd1286fa4f27e82c17c699a866085cc5cc90a2e3fbb32d5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}